rwtest 1
test "Darkness changes hunger rate" project="Bernael" group="Genes" created=2026-09-19T00:00:00

# This file owns the whole claim about BX_Gene_NourishingDarkness_Hediff. Until
# 2026-09-21 a sibling "Darkness drives hunger" asserted the severity alone,
# through the same two "sky glow=" lines - a strict subset of this file, not a
# second claim, so it is gone and the severity asserts below are what is left of
# it. The two stages of the hediff carry nothing but a hungerRateFactor, so the
# severity is a means and this is the end:
#
#   severity 1 (dark or darklight) -> hungerRateFactor 0.5
#   severity 2 (anything brighter) -> hungerRateFactor 2
#
# "hungerrate" reads HediffSet.HungerRateFactor, the product over all hediffs,
# not nutrition per day - so the numbers below are the def's own and do not
# depend on body size, age or the difficulty's food setting. Nothing else in
# this mod writes hungerRateFactor, so the product has exactly one factor in it.
#
# Hediff_NourishingDarkness reads GroundGlowAt every 180 ticks and compares it
# against 0.50, so the light is this test's precondition and the severity is what
# it produces. The visual checks below leave that rendering claim to `ask`; 240
# is one full 180-tick check plus margin, in both directions.

requires dlc=Biotech
spawn Pawn:Colonist at 0,0 name="Bernael" xenotype=BX_Bernael
assert pawn "Bernael" hediff=BX_Gene_NourishingDarkness_Hediff expect=present

sky glow=0
ask "darkness-ground-dark" claim="the unroofed ground under Bernael is visibly dark"
tick 240 reason="Hediff_NourishingDarkness reads the glow every 180 ticks"
assert pawn "Bernael" hediff=BX_Gene_NourishingDarkness_Hediff severity max=1
assert pawn "Bernael" hungerrate min=0.45 max=0.55

sky glow=1
# The budget here used to be 720 and the comment said it was measured, not
# derived: the run of 2026-09-20 22:46 needed ~470 game ticks to get the ground
# glow back over 0.50 after "sky glow=1", while the downward direction held at
# t=0.00. That asymmetry was a RimDevKit question, it was filed as one, and the
# kit answered it on 2026-09-21: SkyManager.SkyManagerUpdate overwrote the
# pinned glow every frame and the pin ran a step behind it, and GroundGlowAt
# drops the sky entirely for a roofed cell, so a pawn that had wandered under a
# roof could never pass 0.5 from the sky at all. The pin is now re-applied in a
# postfix on vanilla's own write, and the replay clears the ground it builds on.
#
# So the budget is derived again and reads like its sibling above: one 180-tick
# check plus margin. The visual check keeps the lighting precondition visible
# without treating an implementation reading as the player's result.
ask "darkness-ground-bright" claim="the unroofed ground under Bernael is visibly bright"
tick 240 reason="Hediff_NourishingDarkness reads the glow every 180 ticks"
assert pawn "Bernael" hediff=BX_Gene_NourishingDarkness_Hediff severity min=2
assert pawn "Bernael" hungerrate min=1.9 max=2.1

assert log clean
